    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=400 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Reaper Hunt: Survivor</strong></u> is a single-player action roguelike shooter that merges fast-paced bullet hell combat with strategic depth in a dark, atmospheric world of magic and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the unique characters, each boasting distinct abilities tailored to different playstyles. Venture into ever-changing levels through dynamic portals that transport you to new, unpredictable arenas teeming with relentless foes and formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6+ enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >skill tree, upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/e09706f97c58233048434b9310c84ea9.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/e09706f97c58233048434b9310c84ea9.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/e09706f97c58233048434b9310c84ea9.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/78c3091318ab2f810e4c67cd468b033c.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/78c3091318ab2f810e4c67cd468b033c.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/78c3091318ab2f810e4c67cd468b033c.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8b9812472e0b82dbba413a6db6ebd6cd.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8b9812472e0b82dbba413a6db6ebd6cd.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8b9812472e0b82dbba413a6db6ebd6cd.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=400 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/8fdf8733d6711e43fac83a046574eaa7.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.poster.avif?t=1755686640\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.webm?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551540/extras/407374cdb0c781c3607a1e44ac572fad.mp4?t=1755686640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Reaper Hunt: Survivor</strong></u> is a single-player action roguelike shooter that merges fast-paced bullet hell combat with strategic depth in a dark, atmospheric world of magic and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the unique characters, each boasting distinct abilities tailored to different playstyles. Venture into ever-changing levels through dynamic portals that transport you to new, unpredictable arenas teeming with relentless foes and formidable bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stron